              "text": "<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><a href=\"http://www.platingthatfits.com/\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Plating</span></a></span></span> <span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><a href=\"http://www.platingthatfits.com/\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">that fits.</span></a></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Our plating portfolio ranges from indication specific plates and patented Smartlock technology to streamlined instrumentation for ease-of-use in the OR. Solving complicated fractures with simple innovative solutions – Plating that fits.</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 26 2019 20:28:26 GMT+0000",
